ts.mccisland.net%2Fmedia%2Fprd%2Ffav_3ef8965e1a.png&w=32&q=75\" alt=\"MCC Island Icon\" width=\"3%\" height=\"3%\"> MCC Island Store</a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/kispintyi\" target=\"blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a01c01ea919180939bc_support_me_on_kofi_badge_blue-p-500.png\" alt=\"Support me on Ko-fi\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"https://store.mccisland.net/login\" target=\"blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BO3pO3Us/images/ca909f808298becdf1f33502a062393faaf438fc.png\" alt=\"OR Buy me something at the MCC Island Store\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<b>NOTE:</b> After <b>purchasing anything</b> for <b>my character</b> from the <b>MCC Island Store</b>, please <b>send the invoice of your purchase</b> to <b><a href=\"mailto:kispintyiyt@gmail.com\">my e-mail address</a></b> (while <b>censoring personal information)</b> along with the <b>name</b> and <b>profile picture</b> you'd like to be <b>displayed as</b> so I can <b>properly credit you!</b>\n<details><summary>This is how an MCC Island Tebex receipt looks like:</summary>\n\n<b>You need to censor it like this:</b>\n<p align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BO3pO3Us/images/311eb9db1df9a99a4f34088fd0e26d2c413d63c5.png\" alt=\"MCC Island Tebex Invoice\"></p>\n\n</details>\n\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/kispintyi\" target=\"blank\"><img alt=\"kofi-singular\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular_64h.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://store.mccisland.net/login\" target=\"blank\"><img alt=\"generic-singular\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BO3pO3Us/images/c2eb8105a9fd2296864638903f89a4071dbcf8c5.png\"></a>\n\n# 💬 FAQ 💬\n<h3>Q: Why there isn't <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/no-chat-reports\" target=\"blank\">No Chat Reports</a> and <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/no-chat-restrictions\" target=\"blank\">No Chat Restrictions</a> in this modpack?</h3>\n<p>\n    A: According to <a href=\"https://mccisland.net/help/mods\" target=\"blank\">MCC Island's Approved Mods page</a> they are disallowed.\n</p>\n<details>\n    <summary>Click to show image</summary>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gbBzIbI.png\" alt=\"MCC Island Mod Rules\">\n    <p>they say, \"It allows you to interact with the server differently\"</p>\n</details>\n\n<h3>Q: Are mods like <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/appleskin\" target=\"blank\">AppleSkin</a> and <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/detail-armor-bar\" target=\"blank\">Detail Armor Bar</a> bannable?</h3>\n<p>\n    A: While these mods gives some advantage, according to <a href=\"https://mcchampionship.com/help/mods/\" target=\"blank\">MCC Island's Approved Mods page</a>, they are allowed.\n</p>\n<details>\n    <summary>Click to show image</summary>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Xw7lkze.png\" alt=\"MCC Island Mod Rules\">\n</details>\n\n<h3>Q: Is there a Toggle Sprint in this modpack?</h3>\n<p>\n    A: There is a toggle sprint feature on vanilla now.<br>\n    Just go to <code>Options</code> > <code>Accessibility Settings</code> and change the <code>Sprint</code> from <code>Hold</code> to <code>Toggle</code>\n</p>\n\n## 👾 Discord Server 👾\n<p>You can <b>get support, report issues and give feedback here:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/XCVbVPYm66\" target=\"blank\"><img alt=\"discord-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\"></a></p>\n\n# ⚠️ DISCLAIMER ⚠️\n**NONE of the mods listed here or in the modpack are mine! Some assets are Noxcrew's and Moonsworth's property!\nI'm not affiliated with or supported by Noxcrew/MCC Island/Moonsworth (Lunar Client) or any of these mods and projects!**\n<br>\n\n### ❗ Have Feedback?\nhttps://forms.gle/Ws8jUFqZ7LqbP9M19\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/sop\" target=\"blank\"><img alt=\"simply-optimized\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/built-with/simply-optimized_64h.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.lunarclient.com/news/how-to-use-modrinth-modpacks-on-lunar-client\" target=\"blank\"><img alt=\"Supports Lunar Client Button\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BO3pO3Us/images/fd9b0e3f188250d38fee5c50bf6fbe503589b2d2.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://feathermc.com\" target=\"blank\"><img alt=\"Supports Feather Client Button\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BO3pO3Us/images/471bf55c71bcbdd5509044455e516b571acc0ecd.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/mcc-island-for-lunar-client\" target=\"blank\"><img alt=\"Built on MCC Island for Lunar Client Modpack\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BO3pO3Us/images/90141542263a7d6191f5c0e05fff8e9475f50c1a.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://mcchampionship.com/threads/guide-optimized-client-for-playing-on-mcci.2943/\" target=\"blank\"><img alt=\"Built on MCC Island Optimised Client Forum Post from the MCC Island Team\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BO3pO3Us/images/7f101384ee8f843fd02f8f17088216df52f15ec7.png\"></a>",
